        l\xEAn h\xE3y quan s\xE1t t\xECm ch\u1ED7 n\xE0o kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ng\u1ECDn
        l\u1EEDa v\xE0 ch\u1EA1y v\xE0o \u0111\xF3.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7077913687530124535, guid: 72e1668017a691b458b25772e030be7f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\"Sau m\u1ED9t th\u1EDDi gian c\xE1nh c\u1ED5ng s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 m\u1EDF.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7077913687530124535, guid: 72e1668017a691b458b25772e030be7f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\"Ta \u0111\xE3 t\u1EEBng qua \u0111\xE2y r\u1ED3i nh\u01B0ng l\xE2u
        qu\xE1 ch\u1EAFc gi\u1EDD m\u1EADt m\xE3 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED5i
        r\u1ED3i\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7763606146520050264, guid: 72e1668017a691b458b25772e030be7f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
